A||||5||peterh||How to shorten turning radius||||1||
Z||000000||peterh||03-15-2001||08:35 AM||||I have a 1986 SEV6 and am asking if anyone has done some minor grinding on the front suspension to shorten the turning radius?<BR>I do not want to weaken the suspension parts, just remove maybe 1/8".<P><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||Tigger||03-15-2001||09:10 AM||||Um, I'm not sure, but I would be suprised if anyone here has done something like this.  The steering rack and suspension points are designed to work together.  Trying to change the wheel lock positions, you would have to consider the possibilities with interferences between rim to shock, etc.||||reg||1
Z||000002||1FST2M6||03-15-2001||09:19 AM||||uumm.. the easiest way to shorten the turning radius.. is to tap the gas when your turning...  works for me...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000003||bHooper||03-15-2001||10:06 AM||||or lay into the throttle, with a slight quick jerk of the wheel... in the direction you want to go, of course.<P>i've used that method for years... very effective.<P>btw, what size tires are you using?  this could affect it, as well as the dmaper, on the rack.<P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR>Red '86 GT<BR>KYB's, Eibach's,<BR>Poly Bushings||||reg||1
Z||000004||peterh||03-15-2001||10:18 AM||||I am using 215/60 tires on 14 by 6 rim. I am not trying to radically change my front suspension. I am used to the very small turning radius on my 1988 Volvo 740 which is rear drive, just trying to improve the Fiero a little bit.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000005||FieroJoe||03-15-2001||10:21 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by peterh:<BR><B> I am used to the very small turning radius on my 1988 Volvo 740 which is rear drive</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>I know exactly what you are talking about!  My 86 240DL wagon turns better than my Fiero!<P>Just probably the engineerings of the whole suspension and steering.  Can't say that the volvo handles better than my Fiero though!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>AIM: Snowboarder0311<BR>87 Coupe 5sp. - big resto in progress<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/profile_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
